# Four representative displacement-product ranks

Literal ATLAS kernel words represent the four conjugacy orbits needed for
all independent pairs in the finite census. Packed products and explicit
row-space certificates prove ranks 16, 16, 16 and 20. Numerical data are
witnesses only; every equation is checked by Lean kernel reduction.
Source: Kleidman--Wilson (1988), pp.488--489; original ATLAS J4G1-max2W1
matrices, with attribution retained in TwoCoreCentralizer/source/README.md.
-/
